## What it does

A developer API platform for one of the largest Philippine telecom providers.
Businesses connect to it to integrate carrier-level features directly into their
websites, mobile apps, and software systems: SMS, voice, location, rewards,
geofencing, and USSD.

## Approach

Maintained the public APIs and the microservices behind them, and wrote the
documentation and onboarding guides that external developers used to integrate.

## Operations

Owned much of the DevOps side: kept the services up and monitored, handled
scaling and deployments, and wrote root-cause-analysis reports after incidents.
The day-to-day work was heavily focused on AWS services.

## Stack

Flask and Node.js in a microservices setup on AWS (EC2, API Gateway, CloudWatch).
